<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 2.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 2.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Wednesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- Central Council of Constitutional Democratic Rally ruling party to meet on October 24-26 in Tunis.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- New industrial zones to be set up soon.</p>
<p>ASSABAH</p>
<p>- Foreign Affairs Minister Habib Ben Yahia tells the U.N. General Assembly in New York that Israel must reconsider its current policy.</p>
</text>
